  "body": "## Changelog\n* 459ed4c33022ee3dad8fdcfffee0505f69646918 Trace additional customer workflows (#5476)\n* f970b6bb99cd978679c6ea768addca4826631e5b Retry release-command starts while the Machine build finishes (#5463)\n* 4674c0b8e01f01c386b48348b751bd025e4f3ef4 Remove region's unused `Capacity` field. (#5472)\n* fca430f7e2ffc4670630a12b9c713a3cf4f08c95 Report expired launch sessions instead of “not found” (#5458)\n* b3491ba45524397d982e8846cabe1a62c666ffd1 Keep the WireGuard error when a deploy's HTTPS failover fails too (#5456)\n* 5047263ac9ae89ff4e0cb289f54bd0c6c7801cee Send the provider with fly redis reset (#5467)\n* b571a471cc3ed0d790ebe096c2d61765ca035b3c Say the feedback API is not a support channel (#5471)\n* dfaaf8be8634ecefb2f9c3affe2fb49d94ff68bb Test critical command paths and report partial failures (#5400)\n* 0841d95e719c9be33d64b39626781bc8d7b99c49 Stop sending expected errors to Sentry (#5434)\n* f332699ccf71f667debb09ef9b808d67ee7c3540 Point the high availability notice at --ha=false (#5430)\n* 85fc71a19b5e3fb69cb3410635c92367831b6586 Stop Laravel's default .env from provisioning Redis (#5455)\n* d399f16ec1f89b0ec89ba131acd9dd2619d243e8 Say what turning off high availability means at launch (#5454)\n* 330013e60c7f06bfc861857229b14f99ebae77d1 Pass --autostop with = in the machine create and run MCP tools (#5452)\n* 463b50186c60ee9c9c1237de1ea794447c68e077 Add fly mpg maintenance-window show/set (#5447)\n* dba4e16101246cfc813691507295b2353ac65c1b Add a missing period to the fly tokens create help text (#5444)\n\n"
}
